(7541013, 1207120, 56502, '<td valign="top">I wonder what they are playing or what sport it is - is there a ball somewhere? It''s a bit random, with no focus point that grabs my attention.</td>', 'I wonder what they are playing or what sport it is - is there a ball somewhere? It''s a bit random, with no focus point that grabs my attention.', '2017-10-26 05:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541014, 1207158, 56502, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the girl with the huge, sort of threatening cars around her. I think having her in focus would have improved it.</td>', 'I like the concept of the girl with the huge, sort of threatening cars around her. I think having her in focus would have improved it.', '2017-10-26 05:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541015, 1207121, 23394, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the concept. I don''t know if it matters or not, but my OCD kicks in when I see images like this. I want things symmetrical. If I can''t see a purpose for the ball not to be horizontally centered in the frame, I feel like you don''t care. While I can handle the haphazard lack of housekeeping, I also can''t help but feel that a little closer attention to grass and dirt patterns could have made this more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting take on the concept. I don''t know if it matters or not, but my OCD kicks in when I see images like this. I want things symmetrical. If I can''t see a purpose for the ball not to be horizontally centered in the frame, I feel like you don''t care. While I can handle the haphazard lack of housekeeping, I also can''t help but feel that a little closer attention to grass and dirt patterns could have made this more interesting.', '2017-10-26 05:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541016, 1207163, 23394, '<td valign="top">I''ve been around hear long enough to be able to recite most of the debates about whether an entry is the image or the entry-and-the-title. For me, it''s the image. While I can appreciate a clever title (a la scalvert), the image is first. I''m also a believer that an image should speak for itself.<br/> <br/>Visually, you have an arresting image. DPC-wise, though, you have a shoe-horn entry tethered by a title that without which I would not really consider a sports-related image. So, while I can appreciate the image, I can''t really give it high marks for meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been around hear long enough to be able to recite most of the debates about whether an entry is the image or the entry-and-the-title. For me, it''s the image. While I can appreciate a clever title (a la scalvert), the image is first. I''m also a believer that an image should speak for itself. Visually, you have an arresting image. DPC-wise, though, you have a shoe-horn entry tethered by a title that without which I would not really consider a sports-related image. So, while I can appreciate the image, I can''t really give it high marks for meeting the challenge.', '2017-10-26 06:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541017, 1207158, 23394, '<td valign="top">I admire your courage, either in trying to photograph someone you care for while in this proximity to them riding in traffic or in you photographing a child you don''t know. Part of me hopes this was just a random grab and not a setup shot because traffic is no place to be playing around. On the other hand, if you''re in an urban environment, I''m quite sure there would have been plenty of other opportunities to photograph kids playing some type of game that could actually be considered ''sports''...</td>', 'I admire your courage, either in trying to photograph someone you care for while in this proximity to them riding in traffic or in you photographing a child you don''t know. Part of me hopes this was just a random grab and not a setup shot because traffic is no place to be playing around. On the other hand, if you''re in an urban environment, I''m quite sure there would have been plenty of other opportunities to photograph kids playing some type of game that could actually be considered ''sports''...', '2017-10-26 06:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541018, 1207116, 23394, '<td valign="top">Honestly, not a fan. Too much to think about without really feeling like I''m seeing something related to ''sports''...</td>', 'Honestly, not a fan. Too much to think about without really feeling like I''m seeing something related to ''sports''...', '2017-10-26 06:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541019, 1207073, 23394, '<td valign="top">nah...<br/> <br/>If the challenge was ''studio portrait'' or ''sports portrait'' you would have a winner!<br/> <br/>But, IMHO, without a verb, this doesn''t really say ''sports'' to me. I can give you points for technical proficiency, for sure, but not for anything else.<br/> <br/>Just wondering, though, whether you''d considered trying some other ''action'' type poses...</td>', 'nah... If the challenge was ''studio portrait'' or ''sports portrait'' you would have a winner! But, IMHO, without a verb, this doesn''t really say ''sports'' to me. I can give you points for technical proficiency, for sure, but not for anything else. Just wondering, though, whether you''d considered trying some other ''action'' type poses...', '2017-10-26 06:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541020, 1207017, 23394, '<td valign="top">Totally meets the challenge!<br/> <br/>What next? Making a compelling image that says more than you had your camera at a kid''s soccer game. If you want to score points, you have to do a little more. Next time, try sitting on the ground, or laying on the ground. Change in perspective can have a dramatic effect on your images.</td>', 'Totally meets the challenge! What next? Making a compelling image that says more than you had your camera at a kid''s soccer game. If you want to score points, you have to do a little more. Next time, try sitting on the ground, or laying on the ground. Change in perspective can have a dramatic effect on your images.', '2017-10-26 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541021, 1207090, 23394, '<td valign="top">BAM!<br/> <br/>truly visionary</td>', 'BAM! truly visionary', '2017-10-26 06:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
