(7541052, 1206917, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, this should do well. but, i can''t put it at the top. let me explain. what you have here is an eye-level documentation of the marathon. by changing your perspective you could have added some serious interest to the image. check out <a href="//skippix.biz/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/150927-uci-worlds-sunday-0616-print-ready.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this image</a> to see what i mean.</td>', 'ok, this should do well. but, i can''t put it at the top. let me explain. what you have here is an eye-level documentation of the marathon. by changing your perspective you could have added some serious interest to the image. check out this image to see what i mean.', '2017-10-26 13:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541075, 1207164, 23394, '<td valign="top">this image has a lot going for it, except for one simple, crucial thing...the subject''s face.<br/> <br/>i''m going to hold that against you. because. obviously, you have the equipment and the ability to use it. and this isn''t a typical, adult-eye-level perspective. so, out of all the opportunities that had to present themselves to you on that beautiful afternoon, were you not able to get one of someone bringing the ball <i>at you?</i> of course, i know all this sounds harsh, but, after all, this is dpc and most voters aren''t going to tell you why they vote they way they do. now, it''s not that i''m voting it low - no, not all all. i''m just not giving it the highest marks. all that being said, keep on clicking. hope you''re having fun with it!</td>', 'this image has a lot going for it, except for one simple, crucial thing...the subject''s face. i''m going to hold that against you. because. obviously, you have the equipment and the ability to use it. and this isn''t a typical, adult-eye-level perspective. so, out of all the opportunities that had to present themselves to you on that beautiful afternoon, were you not able to get one of someone bringing the ball at you? of course, i know all this sounds harsh, but, after all, this is dpc and most voters aren''t going to tell you why they vote they way they do. now, it''s not that i''m voting it low - no, not all all. i''m just not giving it the highest marks. all that being said, keep on clicking. hope you''re having fun with it!', '2017-10-26 21:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541076, 1207152, 23394, '<td valign="top">yep, action! nailed it on pretty much all the technicals! popping colors! <br/> <br/>i''m scoring it fairly high, just not as high as i would had you gotten something coming into the frame rather than going out of it. forward facing nearly always beats rear facing, unless there''s a point to seeing where something is going...and that''s not really the case here. all the same, i''m sure this will do well and i hope you''re having fun with it!</td>', 'yep, action! nailed it on pretty much all the technicals! popping colors!  i''m scoring it fairly high, just not as high as i would had you gotten something coming into the frame rather than going out of it. forward facing nearly always beats rear facing, unless there''s a point to seeing where something is going...and that''s not really the case here. all the same, i''m sure this will do well and i hope you''re having fun with it!', '2017-10-26 21:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541077, 1206999, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome take on the challenge. serious story-telling, interest-arresting image. thanks for submitting.</td>', 'awesome take on the challenge. serious story-telling, interest-arresting image. thanks for submitting.', '2017-10-26 21:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541078, 1207156, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow.<br/> <br/>doesn''t get much better than this in terms of telling the story. i am jealous.</td>', 'wow. doesn''t get much better than this in terms of telling the story. i am jealous.', '2017-10-26 21:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541079, 1207166, 23394, '<td valign="top">killer. absolutely.<br/> <br/>unfortunately, probably way too subtle for this crowd. don''t let the scores get you. you just keep doing what you''re doing and have fun with it.</td>', 'killer. absolutely. unfortunately, probably way too subtle for this crowd. don''t let the scores get you. you just keep doing what you''re doing and have fun with it.', '2017-10-26 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541080, 1207130, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image. will be interesting to see how the voting crowd treats it. all the same, thanks for a refreshing pause.</td>', 'nice image. will be interesting to see how the voting crowd treats it. all the same, thanks for a refreshing pause.', '2017-10-26 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541081, 1206929, 23394, '<td valign="top">how bout you! isn''t it cool that ballparks still let fans bring in decent gear!<br/> <br/>hope you were able to enjoy the game, as well ;-)</td>', 'how bout you! isn''t it cool that ballparks still let fans bring in decent gear! hope you were able to enjoy the game, as well ;-)', '2017-10-26 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541082, 1207057, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image. hope the voters treat it kindly...</td>', 'nice image. hope the voters treat it kindly...', '2017-10-26 21:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541083, 1207169, 23394, '<td valign="top">you''re heading in the right direction, but i imagine you''re a little frustrated. this image has everything going for it except for image quality - and there''s not much you can do about that without spending money on a fast, long lens. if you''re not sure, trying renting one. it''s obvious that you are pushing your gear as far as it will go and sometimes you have to bite the bullet to move yourself along.<br/> <br/>as for the image, ordinarily i advocate for a lower than eye-level perspective, but this is ok here. i''d still suggest trying a lower perspective next time you get a chance, either sitting or laying on the ground.</td>', 'you''re heading in the right direction, but i imagine you''re a little frustrated. this image has everything going for it except for image quality - and there''s not much you can do about that without spending money on a fast, long lens. if you''re not sure, trying renting one. it''s obvious that you are pushing your gear as far as it will go and sometimes you have to bite the bullet to move yourself along. as for the image, ordinarily i advocate for a lower than eye-level perspective, but this is ok here. i''d still suggest trying a lower perspective next time you get a chance, either sitting or laying on the ground.', '2017-10-26 21:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541085, 1206979, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, sports. yes, in focus and properly exposed. compelling? interesting? visually appealing? eh, not really...<br/> <br/>ask yourself: is there any other way you could have approached this opportunity that could have resulted in an interesting, compelling image? most likely. it''s ok to grab a safety, documentary shot, but that''s not what''s going to capture the votes.<br/> <br/>one of the most important things to do is to be aware of your backgrounds. do the best you can to avoid or mitigate background clutter that can distract your viewers. isolate your subjects. <br/> <br/>and, whenever possible, shoot the verb. try to visualize this. if you had moved down to the line the kids were on and gotten slightly out in front, just enough to see down the line. and then you waited until they were all throwing. now *that* would have been a shot!<br/> <br/>all the same, keep on clicking! hope you''re having fun with it!</td>', 'yes, sports. yes, in focus and properly exposed. compelling? interesting? visually appealing? eh, not really... ask yourself: is there any other way you could have approached this opportunity that could have resulted in an interesting, compelling image? most likely. it''s ok to grab a safety, documentary shot, but that''s not what''s going to capture the votes. one of the most important things to do is to be aware of your backgrounds. do the best you can to avoid or mitigate background clutter that can distract your viewers. isolate your subjects.  and, whenever possible, shoot the verb. try to visualize this. if you had moved down to the line the kids were on and gotten slightly out in front, just enough to see down the line. and then you waited until they were all throwing. now *that* would have been a shot! all the same, keep on clicking! hope you''re having fun with it!', '2017-10-26 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541086, 1206871, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but i''m not big on the image quality or post-processing. better-than-average perspective, but still would like to see more of the front tire.</td>', 'nice idea, but i''m not big on the image quality or post-processing. better-than-average perspective, but still would like to see more of the front tire.', '2017-10-26 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
