(7541852, 1207073, 113016, '<td valign="top">hmmm.... thankyou for the love everyone.<br/>I have to agree with many of you that I WISH I had an ''action'' shot to have submitted. <br/>I had rented the stage, and had reached out to a couple Dojo''s in an effort to get a pair of Kendo warriors.  At the last minute they fell thru and I posted a ''Casting Call'' on my FB page for someone to help with with my Young Athletes project.  Sequoia Magdalena hit me back and said he''d help.  He''s a Sophomore at ND High School in ShermanOaks CA.  Playing wide out and Free Safety.  A SWEET kid that had a hard time giving me a ''look''.  Nothing like the kid that I see in his highlight reels who is a terror at FreeSafety.  Thanks Sequoia!</td>', 'hmmm.... thankyou for the love everyone.I have to agree with many of you that I WISH I had an ''action'' shot to have submitted. I had rented the stage, and had reached out to a couple Dojo''s in an effort to get a pair of Kendo warriors.  At the last minute they fell thru and I posted a ''Casting Call'' on my FB page for someone to help with with my Young Athletes project.  Sequoia Magdalena hit me back and said he''d help.  He''s a Sophomore at ND High School in ShermanOaks CA.  Playing wide out and Free Safety.  A SWEET kid that had a hard time giving me a ''look''.  Nothing like the kid that I see in his highlight reels who is a terror at FreeSafety.  Thanks Sequoia!', '2017-11-01 01:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541859, 1207165, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Wot, no wildlife! Only joking Ronnie, a great action capture of a unique event. I like the sense of motion created by the trails of smoke and flame. I do not like the expanse of blank sky at the top its not helping the image at all. I think a panorama with the bulk of the sky cropped out and  a little more room either side of the action would have given this more impact.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Wot, no wildlife! Only joking Ronnie, a great action capture of a unique event. I like the sense of motion created by the trails of smoke and flame. I do not like the expanse of blank sky at the top its not helping the image at all. I think a panorama with the bulk of the sky cropped out and  a little more room either side of the action would have given this more impact.', '2017-11-01 06:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541860, 1207150, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Welcome back Skip! And what a comeback The composition and timing is a delight. Too often the temptation is to go in close on the action and concentrate on that whereas the bigger picture can often have more appeal and impact. The quality of the light too is the essence of your lovely image, it highlights the undulations in the land together with those lovely shadows it works very well. Congratulations for your high score and placing, I hope we will be seeing more of your work again?</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Welcome back Skip! And what a comeback The composition and timing is a delight. Too often the temptation is to go in close on the action and concentrate on that whereas the bigger picture can often have more appeal and impact. The quality of the light too is the essence of your lovely image, it highlights the undulations in the land together with those lovely shadows it works very well. Congratulations for your high score and placing, I hope we will be seeing more of your work again?', '2017-11-01 06:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541878, 1207073, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wow well done - superb sports theme portrait. Really love the smoke - did you use a smoke machine for that? Congrat on the blue</td>', 'Wow well done - superb sports theme portrait. Really love the smoke - did you use a smoke machine for that? Congrat on the blue', '2017-11-01 07:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
