(7541963, 1207073, 141319, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PaulFrocchi:</b></div><hr/><i> hmmm.... thankyou for the love everyone.<br/>I have to agree with many of you that I WISH I had an ''action'' shot to have submitted. <br/>I had rented the stage, and had reached out to a couple Dojo''s in an effort to get a pair of Kendo warriors.  At the last minute they fell thru and I posted a ''Casting Call'' on my FB page for someone to help with with my Young Athletes project.  Sequoia Magdalena hit me back and said he''d help.  He''s a Sophomore at ND High School in ShermanOaks CA.  Playing wide out and Free Safety.  A SWEET kid that had a hard time giving me a ''look''.  Nothing like the kid that I see in his highlight reels who is a terror at FreeSafety.  Thanks Sequoia! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for clarifying :-) - I now close to zero about American Football and had no idea who Sequoia Magdalena is, and thought you had entered the big league with some famous athlete :-). Whoever, whatever, I love this image. Really, really cool.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by PaulFrocchi: hmmm.... thankyou for the love everyone.I have to agree with many of you that I WISH I had an ''action'' shot to have submitted. I had rented the stage, and had reached out to a couple Dojo''s in an effort to get a pair of Kendo warriors.  At the last minute they fell thru and I posted a ''Casting Call'' on my FB page for someone to help with with my Young Athletes project.  Sequoia Magdalena hit me back and said he''d help.  He''s a Sophomore at ND High School in ShermanOaks CA.  Playing wide out and Free Safety.  A SWEET kid that had a hard time giving me a ''look''.  Nothing like the kid that I see in his highlight reels who is a terror at FreeSafety.  Thanks Sequoia!   Thanks for clarifying :-) - I now close to zero about American Football and had no idea who Sequoia Magdalena is, and thought you had entered the big league with some famous athlete :-). Whoever, whatever, I love this image. Really, really cool.', '2017-11-02 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541967, 1207099, 45631, '<td valign="top">Love this. The minimalism really works for me.</td>', 'Love this. The minimalism really works for me.', '2017-11-02 04:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541972, 1207073, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific image and well deserving of the Blue. The theme was sports. Nowhere did the challenge description specify action. If this doesn''t represent a sports theme, I have *NO* idea what does. Doesn''t matter what anyone else''s interpretation may be. Besides..... Obviously the voters were in agreement that this is a spectacular image that met the challenge. Congrats!</td>', 'Terrific image and well deserving of the Blue. The theme was sports. Nowhere did the challenge description specify action. If this doesn''t represent a sports theme, I have *NO* idea what does. Doesn''t matter what anyone else''s interpretation may be. Besides..... Obviously the voters were in agreement that this is a spectacular image that met the challenge. Congrats!', '2017-11-02 10:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
